    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8330" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circum-tĕgo</span></b> ,
		ĕre, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to cover round about</i>
			(post-class.): 
