				 <i><span class="en">Dict. Cret. 3, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arca testamenti circumtecta ex omni parte auro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Heb. 9, 4</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">v. also the spurious line,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					1, 1094</span></i>
			 Lachm. and Munro ad loc.</div>
